{"id":"neizbezhno","lemma":"неизбежно","pos":"adv","rank":3744,"glosses":["inevitably"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это неизбежно.","en":"It's inevitable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/928230","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Думаю, теперь это неизбежно.","en":"I think it's inevitable now.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Это же было неизбежно?","en":"It was inevitable, wasn't it?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"(emphasis)"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, что это неизбежно.","en":"I know it's inevitable.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"То, что здесь произошло, было неизбежно.","en":"What happened here was unavoidable.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to take place","l":"произойти"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}